      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so i took my zoloft like usual and then took a tramadol for my back pain a little while ago. i thought it would be fine but now my heart is pounding really fast and i can't stop sweating. i'm feeling super jittery and kinda lightheaded. i really don't want to go to the hospital because the last time i went i sat in the waiting room for 8 hours and they basically did nothing, plus i can't afford the bill. is there something i can just take here at home to make this stop?",
